robable that this would be discussed next.\n\nB) The unique effect of artemisinin in the treatment of lupus erythematosus.\n- The context mentions that new progress has been made in the treatment of lupus erythematosus using artemisinin.This is a specific application of the drug and would likely be discussed next.\nThe solution to the problem of drug resistance of artemisinin.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
