fforts and the attainment of a collective goal succeeds in leading these people to this goal.\n- This option is consistent with the context. It suggests that if a leader successfully conveys the relationship between their efforts and the goal, they will lead the followers to the goal. This aligns with the context's emphasis on both the necessity of efforts and their effectiveness.\n\nBased on this analysis, the option that cannot be true is C.\n</think>\n<answer>\nC\n</answer>",
