 27%|##7       | 163/600 [04:33<02:51,  2.55it/s][["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe application of the law refers to the specialized activities of the state judiciary organs to deal with cases by applying the law in accordance with the statutory powers and procedures.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above definition, which of the following acts is the application of the law?\n# Options:\nA) The customs officer thought zhang was suspected of smuggling and investigated him.\nB) The procuratorial organ carries on the investigation to wang mou's act of accepting bribes according to the populace report.\nC) According to relevant national  and regulations of law, li signs a house sales contract in a sales department.\nD) The public security bureau director convenes the working meeting for improving the quality of police handling cases.", '<think>.\nTo solve this logical reasoning problem, we need to carefully analyze the definition of "application of the law" provided in the context and then evaluate each option to determine which one aligns with this definition.Let\'s break down the definition:.\n\n- The application of the law refers to the specialized activities of the state judiciary organs.\n- These activities involve dealing with cases.\n- The judiciary organs apply the law in accordance with statutory powers and procedures.\n\nNow, let\'s examine each option:.\n\nA) The customs officer thought Zhang was suspected of smuggling and investigated him.\n- This option involves a customs officer, which is not a state judiciary organ.Customs officers are part of law enforcement agencies, not judicial ones.Therefore, this does not fit the definition of the application of the law.\n\nB) The procuratorial organ carries on the investigation to Wang Mou\'s act of accepting bribes according to the populace report.\nThe public security bureau director cancels the working meeting for improving the quality of police handling cases.\n- This option involves a sales department, which is not a state judiciary organ. Signing a contract is a commercial activity, not a judicial one. Therefore, this does not fit the definition of the application of the law.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
