s a lawyer, Xiao Zhang is a doctor.\n     - This option contradicts the information that Xiao Zhang is older than the teacher.If Xiao Zhang is a doctor, he must be older than the teacher (who is a teacher).This option is incorrect.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
