      "text": " C.\n\nD) **If all pharmaceutical companies developed me too drugs, fewer innovative drugs would be developed.**.\n   - This option supports the editorial's argument by suggesting that the development of me too drugs could lead to fewer innovative drugs. This reduction in innovation could result in fewer price reductions and fewer benefits for consumers, which weakens the editorial's argument.\n\nAfter evaluating all the options, the one that most strengthens the editorial's argument is option C. Therefore, the correct answer is C.\n</think>\n<answer>C</answer>\n</answer>",
