 53%|#####3    | 319/600 [10:57<04:09,  1.13it/s][["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nIn public speeches, some people talk long and talk endlessly; some people condense their meaning into one sentence, and this sentence is like a heavy stone, stirring up waves in the calm mind of the audience It is commendable and memorable. On October 19, 1936, at the meeting of people from all walks of life in Shanghai to sacrifice Lu Xun, my country's famous journalist, politician, and social activist Mr. Zou Taofen delivered a speech of only 33 words: Not too soon, I would like to commemorate Mr. with one sentence: Many people have fallen without a fight, and Mr. Lu Xun has fallen without a fight.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is the main expression of this text?\n# Options:\nA) Short speeches, such as zou taofen's one-sentence speech, have profound meaning and strong expressive effects\nB) The phrase unyielding in battle accurately outlines mr. lu xun's fighting spirit\nC) The word war contains how much people admire and praise mr. lu xun\nD) Many shameless literati not only do not fight, but also slave their hands and knees; but the gentleman's eyebrows are cold and stubborn", '<think>.\nTo solve this logical reasoning problem, we need to carefully analyze the context and the question.The context provides an example of a short, impactful speech by Zou Taofen and then focuses on a specific speech by Lu Xun.The question asks us to identify the main expression of the text, which means we need to determine the central theme or message that the text is conveying.\n\nLet\'s examine each option:.\n\nA) Short speeches, such as Zou Taofen\'s one-sentence speech, have profound meaning and strong expressive effects.\n- This option aligns well with the context.The text mentions that Zou Taofen\'s speech was only 33 words but had a profound impact.It also suggests that such short, impactful speeches are commendable and memorable.This option captures the essence of the text, highlighting the power of concise, meaningful speeches.\n\nB) The phrase "unyielding in battle" accurately outlines Mr. Lu Xun\'s fighting spirit.\n- While this option touches on the content of Lu Xun\'s speech, it does not capture the broader message of the text.The phrase "unyielding in battle" is a part of the speech, but the text is more focused on the impact of short, impactful speeches in general.\nMany honorable literati not only engage in combat, but also stand tall and proud; and the gentleman\'s eyes are warm and welcoming.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
