ase of "weed.".\n   - **Option B:** "All words with strong subjective color are not scientific classification terms.".\n     - This is the same as Option A and is also too broad.\n   - **Option C:** "Some convenient labels with strong subjective color are not scientific classification terms.".\nOption D is a specific statement that directly supports the conclusion that "weed" is a scientific classification term by stating that some convenient labels with strong subjective color are indeed scientific classification terms.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
