 68%|######8   | 408/600 [12:07<02:30,  1.27it/s][['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nVirtual team refers to a community composed of two or more people across regions and organizations. They are connected through communication and information technology. They have complementary technologies or skills, common goals, common evaluation and work methods, and they jointly bear the final results and responsibilities.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above definition, which one of the followings belongs to a virtual team?\n# Options:\nA) A publishing firm contacted several experts to jointly compile a new textbook. they work in different units and coordinating their work is mainly through telephone, fax and network.\nB) A company transferred each two key employees from the sales department, r&d department and production department to form a new product research team.\nC) Xiao li encountered technical problems in his work. he was not familiar with a professional field. he consulted many experts through the internet and telephone, and established regular and fixed contacts with the experts.\nD) Xiao tang, xiao sun and xiao liu often chat on the internet and find that they have similar experiences and common hobbies. so they become good friends.', "<think>.\nTo solve this logical reasoning problem, we need to carefully analyze the definition of a virtual team and each of the given options to determine which one fits the criteria.Let's break down the definition and then evaluate each option:.\n\n1.**Definition of a Virtual Team**:.\n   - Composed of two or more people across regions and organizations.\n   - Connected through communication and information technology.\n   - Complementary technologies or skills.\n   - Common goals.\n   - Common evaluation and work methods.\n   - Jointly bear the final results and responsibilities.\n\n2.**Option A**:.\n   - A publishing firm contacted several experts to jointly compile a new textbook.\n   - They work in different units.\n   - Coordination is mainly through telephone, fax, and network.\n   - This option fits the criteria of a virtual team as it involves multiple experts (people across regions and organizations) working together on a common goal (compiling a textbook) using communication technology (telephone, fax, network).\n\n3.**Option B**:.\n   - A company transferred each two key employees from different departments to form a new product research team.\n   - This option does not fit the criteria of a virtual team because the employees are transferred from different departments within the same organization, not across different regions and organizations.\n\n4.Option A:\n- Xiao Mei is part of a virtual team that collaborates effectively across different locations and organizations.\n- This option fits the criteria of a virtual team as it involves multiple people working together towards a shared goal.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
