messages:  [["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nAviation Analyst: To combat human error involved in air traffic control, Miro Jets Inc. has recently installed each of its DC-10 passenger planes with a special anti-collision device. The device alerts the DC-10, via a red light, when another plane is slightly more than three minutes away from a potential collision. The red light comes on and stays on until the approaching plane is safely out of range. Aviation experts at Miro Jet Inc. have determined that three minutes is ample time for a plane to divert its respective flight path to avoid a collision. Ttherefore, if the red light on the anti-collision device is off, the DC-10 is more than three minutes flying time from any plane.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following, if true, most fundamentally calls into question the aviation analyst's argument?\n# Options:\nA) Recently, a near collision in which both planes were less than 90 seconds flying distance from each other was averted only by the prompt actions of air traffic controllers.\nB) When two dc-10's approach each other the red lights on each aircraft do not necessarily turn on simultaneously.\nC) Some aviation experts warn that in certain cases three minutes may not provide sufficient time for aircrafts to maneuver without causing on board injuries.\nD) The anti-collision device only signals planes of oncoming directions, not those planes that are flying in parallel.", "<think>.\nTo solve this logical reasoning problem, we need to identify which option most fundamentally calls into question the aviation analyst's argument.The analyst's argument hinges on the assumption that if the red light is off, the DC-10 is more than three minutes flying time from any plane.We need to find an option that undermines this assumption or introduces a scenario where the red light being off does not necessarily mean the DC-10 is more than three minutes away from a plane.Don't think about it.\nNo response.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
