 90%|######### | 541/600 [18:28<00:35,  1.68it/s][["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nOn the issue of the selection of the head of the personnel section, a bureau decided to vote by all the staff of the unit. The top three candidates were candidates. Each person only needed to tick the list of employees of the Bureau. The vote counting team found that Zhang Hao, who had just graduated, did not tick anyone; Wang Ming checked all those who checked Zhao Jie; Li Zilu ticked all those who didn't get the full vote\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, from this it follows that:\n# Options:\nA) Wang ming and li zilu didn't tick each other\nB) Wang ming and li zilu tick each other\nC) Wang ming chose li zilu, but li zilu didn't choose wang ming\nD) Wang ming didn't choose li zilu, but li zilu chose wang ming", "<think>.\nTo solve this logical reasoning problem, let's break down the information provided and analyze each step carefully:.\n\n1.**Context Analysis:**.\n   - Zhang Hao did not tick anyone.\n   - Wang Ming checked all those who checked Zhao Jie.\n   - Li Zilu ticked all those who did not get the full vote.\n\n2.**Implications:**.\n   - Since Zhang Hao did not tick anyone, he is not included in the list of ticked candidates.\n   - Wang Ming checked all those who checked Zhao Jie.This means if Zhao Jie was ticked, Wang Ming also ticked Zhao Jie.\n   - Li Zilu ticked all those who did not get the full vote.This means Li Zilu ticked all candidates who were not ticked by anyone else.\n\n3.**Identifying Candidates:**.\n   - Since Zhang Hao did not tick anyone, he is not part of the ticked list.\n   - Let's denote the candidates as A, B, C, D, and E (assuming there are five candidates in total).\n   - Let's assume Zhao Jie was ticked by someone (let's say candidate A).\n\n4.**Analyzing Wang Ming's Action:**.\n   - If Zhao Jie was ticked by someone, Wang Ming would also tick Zhao Jie.\n   - Therefore, Zhao Jie is ticked by Wang Ming.\n\n5.**Analyzing Li Zilu's Action:**.\n   - Li Zilu ticked all those who did not get the full vote.\n   - Since Zhao Jie was ticked by Wang Ming, Zhao Jie is not ticked by Li Zilu.\n   - Therefore, Li Zilu did not tick Zhao Jie.Since Wang Ming ticked Zhao Jie and Li Zilu ticked Zhang Hao (who is not Zhao Jie), the correct answer is that Wang Ming and Li Zilu ticked each other.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
